OL,3,GNEWSAFunding for new 'Mackem' musical
OL,4,Ahistory project
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major new heritage project has been
OL,7,Fawarded funding to preserve
OL,8,FSunderland's musical history.
OL,10,FSunderland Music City has been awarded
OL,11,Fmore than #150,000 by the National
OL,12,FLottery Heritage Fund for its Mackem
OL,13,FMusic Memories project.
OL,15,FThe organisation, that aims to deliver
OL,16,Feconomic, employment, cultural and
OL,17,Fsocial benefits through music, is
OL,18,Finviting residents of the city past and
OL,19,Fpresent to contribute their memories of
OL,20,Fthe music scene to be used in an
OL,21,Fexhibition.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
