OL,3,GNEWSAFunding for new 'Mackem' musical
OL,4,Ahistory project
OL,5,
OL,6,FMusic City's chief executive Michelle
OL,7,FDaurat said she hoped the project would
OL,8,F"become part of Sunderland's permanent
OL,9,Fheritage."
